/// An executions channel push -- a snapshot of open orders and recent fills right after subscribing, then one push per order status transition or fill. The snapshot and update stream share the same data schema; the fields present in each report depend on `exec_type`.
#[derive(Debug, Clone, PartialEq, Serialize, Deserialize)]
